<!--
  Static top-level routes only.

  Dynamic detail routes (/blog/$slug, /careers/$jobId) are content-driven at
  runtime (blog via Heimdall CMS; careers job IDs can change independently of
  a deploy) and are deliberately left out rather than guessed or copied from
  whatever happens to exist right now — a static file has no way to keep pace
  with either, and a stale or invented URL is worse than an absent one.

  /innovation-hub and /innovation-hub/$slug are omitted on purpose: the
  Innovation Hub is being de-promoted from navigation and its detail route is
  becoming orphaned (see W3 in the site audit) — it should not be advertised
  to crawlers as a canonical destination.

  Regenerate this list by hand if the static route table in
  src/routeTree.gen.ts changes.
-->
